### 1. List all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. Filter by author and limit
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?author=Bloch&limit=1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Find book by ID (existing)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Find book by ID (non-existing -> 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create a new book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pro Spring 6",
  "author": "Cosmina",
  "year": 2023
}

### 6. Update existing book (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java (3rd Edition)",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018
}

### 7. Delete book (first call -> 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/2

### 8. Delete book again (second call -> 404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/2

### ==============================================================
### Variant 2: GET /api/books/by-year/{year} (regex: \d{4})
### ==============================================================

### 9. Variant 2: Valid 4-digit year -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/2018
Accept: application/json

### 10. Variant 2: Valid 4-digit year (Spring in Action) -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/2022
Accept: application/json

### 11. Variant 2: Non-matching regex (letters) -> 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/abc
Accept: application/json

### 12. Variant 2: Non-matching regex (2 digits) -> 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/20
Accept: application/json

### 13. Variant 2: Non-matching regex (5 digits) -> 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/20261
Accept: application/json

### ==============================================================
### HTTP Error Experiments (Task 4.3)
### ==============================================================

### 14. GET with bad type -> 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/abc
Accept: application/json

### 15. GET unmapped path -> 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nothing

### 16. DELETE without identifier -> 405 Method Not Allowed
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 17. POST with unsupported Content-Type -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: text/plain

test payload

### 18. GET with unsupported Accept header -> 406 Not Acceptable
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/xml
